Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.95,0:05:52.17,OP_JP_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur1}あふれそうなCry
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.17,0:05:55.21,OP_JP_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur1}Lost in the noise, drowning inside
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.54,0:05:58.09,OP_JP_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur1}But I won't break, I will never lose myself
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.09,0:06:00.22,OP_JP_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur1}So rise again, I find myself
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.22,0:06:04.93,OP_JP_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur1}僕だけの魔法　探していた
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.93,0:06:07.35,OP_JP_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur1}数えきれない　絶望も
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.35,0:06:09.85,OP_JP_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur1}崩れ落ちた　理想も
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.06,0:06:14.40,OP_JP_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur1}一振りの勇気だけ
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.40,0:06:17.02,OP_JP_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur1}Believers, going back, back
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.02,0:06:21.36,OP_JP_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur1}もう　何千何万回の苦難も　恐れない
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.36,0:06:25.07,OP_JP_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur1}ただ　そこに君がいるから
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.07,0:06:27.16,OP_JP_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur1}I'm going back, back
